{"id":"nachbarschaft","lemma":"Nachbarschaft","pos":"noun","rank":2925,"glosses":["neighbourhood","neighbourship","proximity"],"ipa":"/ˈnaxba(ːɐ̯)ʃaft/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e9/De-Nachbarschaft.ogg/De-Nachbarschaft.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Nachbarschaft","plural":"Nachbarschaften"},"examples":[{"text":"Er lebt in dieser Nachbarschaft.","en":"He lives in this neighborhood.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"a state in which…","l":"Leben"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this"},null]},{"text":"Sie lebt in dieser Nachbarschaft.","en":"She lives in this neighborhood.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"a state in which…","l":"Leben"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"this one, this"},null]},{"text":"Hast du die neue Familie in der Nachbarschaft getroffen?","en":"Have you met the new family on the block?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"new","l":"neu"},{"g":"family"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"hit, struck, met"}]},{"text":"In unserer Nachbarschaft ist praktisch jedes Haus gleich.","en":"Every house in our neighborhood is practically identical.","words":[{"g":"in"},{"g":"our","l":"unser"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"practical"},{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"alike"}]},{"text":"Ich war das zäheste Kind in der Nachbarschaft.","en":"I was the toughest kid in the neighborhood.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"kid"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}